// name is ignored; each import is resolved against the runtime builtins, and an
// unresolvable one aborts unless -warn-imports downgrades it to a warning.
// `package foo { ... }` is NOT accepted: the block form was dropped from the language
// long ago, and Kotlin's own psi/packages/PackageBlockFirst.kt records it as an error
// ("Expecting a top level declaration"). The compiler half never had it either.
