    // the set, live here; everything else falls through to kSeqMethod over the
    // elements, which is right because kotlin.collections declares map / filter /
    // sorted / reversed / joinToString / take / ... on Iterable and they all answer a
    // LIST even for a Set receiver. The twin is ktSetMethod in abnf/jsrtkotlin.go.
